        "value": "○櫛羅藩（高上、忍海、葛下、葛上　四郡ノ内村數二十六ヶ村）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "〇櫛羅藩（高上・忍海・葛下・葛上の四郡のうち　村数26か村）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "○Kujira Domain (26 villages within the four districts of Kōjō, Oshimi, Katsuge and Katsujō). The first district is printed 高上; the Yamato district that adjoins Katsujō, Katsuge and Oshimi is normally 高市 (Takaichi), so the printed form is recorded verbatim here. This maru-marker starts Kujira's entry: the columns to its right are Kurobane's, those to its left are Kujira's."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "○櫛羅藩"
